  data: {
    LLM: "Only stay in the hand with a face-up 3 if you have a strong drawing hand or made hand. The pot odds must justify the massive investment required.\n\nWatch opponents' reactions to face-up 3s. Some players will always match, creating enormous pots that justify drawing to weaker hands.\n\nBluff with a face-up 3 by matching the pot with a weak hand, representing strength. This is extremely expensive but can win massive pots against cautious opponents.",
    Player: "Only stay in the hand with a face-up 3 if you have a strong drawing hand or made hand. The pot odds must justify the massive investment required.\n\nWatch opponents' reactions to face-up 3s. Some players will always match, creating enormous pots that justify drawing to weaker hands.\n\nBluff with a face-up 3 by matching the pot with a weak hand, representing strength. This is extremely expensive but can win massive pots against cautious opponents.",
